Description: Metapackage for SpacemiT platform firmware
 This metapackage depends on the SpacemiT platform firmware and boot
 related packages: EDK2, EC firmware, OpenSBI, the U-Boot SPL and ESOS.
 .
 It also ships the unified flashing script that writes the whole
 firmware set (bootinfo, FSBL, U-Boot environment, OpenSBI, ESOS and,
 under UEFI, EDK2) to the boot medium in one verified transaction, and
 re-runs it via dpkg triggers whenever any of the firmware packages
 is upgraded.
